# PHASE 4 — PREMIUM UI/UX REFINEMENT + PERFORMANCE + ACCESSIBILITY + SEO HARDENING

You are continuing work on the existing Gilgal Dental Clinics website.

IMPORTANT:
This is an IMPLEMENTATION phase.

Do NOT perform a visual-QA/screenshot-review phase and do NOT ask me to approve screenshots.
I will personally perform visual QA afterward.

Your job is to IMPLEMENT the premium UI/UX refinements, performance improvements, accessibility hardening, and SEO/technical hardening directly in the existing codebase.

Do not stop at an audit.
Do not merely report recommendations.
Make the changes.

==================================================
