==================================================

Review visible copy while implementing UI refinements.

Remove obvious AI-slop wording.

Avoid:

- "where excellence meets..."
- "your journey begins..."
- "world-class"
- "cutting-edge"
- "revolutionary"
- generic motivational filler
- repetitive adjectives
- empty luxury language

Copy should be:

